    "scenesThatPass": [
      "REALTOR: Good evening.\nZHENYA: Evening!",
      "REALTOR: It's a great neighborhood. Clean air, a metro station opening soon, a shopping center nearby...\nZHENYA: A new church, just recently built.",
      "ZHENYA: Good afternoon! How can I help you?\nCLIENT: I need you to explain to me, my dear, why your website lists one rate, and your people charge another?",
      "CLIENT: When I made the appointment the other day, your website listed 3,000 as the price. And she's charging me three and a half. I come here a lot…\nZHENYA: I'm very sorry. Our rates have gone up, and the website has now been updated. But you are right, it was out of date the day before yesterday…\nCLIENT: I hope this doesn't happen again.\nZHENYA: Of course. Thank you very much. Have a good day.",
      "ZHENYA: Enough. You make her sound like a complete monster.\nLENA: Is there any other way in?"
    ]
  },
